<div class="bb-quote"><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">&nbsp;phantaskippy wrote:<br /><blockquote class="bb-quote-body">&nbsp;That means Guise can borrow a gun and the ammo will stay behind. &nbsp;The follow up question is what happens when the gun is returned, I would think the ammo is still seperate from the gun, but I don&#39;t know if that is how it will be seen officially.&nbsp;
